#: mason/breeders_toolbox/program/add_autogenerated_name_metadata_dialog.mas:175
msgctxt "program.autoname.guide.basename"
msgid "You can specify attributes you would like to include in a basename, as well as the order of these attributes. If you would like to add text field in the basename, select \"text\", then specify the text field. Attributes are separated by an underscore."
msgstr "Puede especificar los atributos del nombre base y su orden. Para añadir un campo de texto al nombre base, seleccione «text» y escriba el texto. Los atributos se separan con un guion bajo."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/program/add_autogenerated_name_metadata_dialog.mas:175
msgctxt "program.autoname.guide.basename_example"
msgid "For example, selecting 3 attributes, if you would like to include breeding program, vector construct, and a text field. The generated name would be %{example} and a %{serial_number}."
msgstr "Por ejemplo, al seleccionar 3 atributos —breeding program, vector construct y un campo de texto—, el nombre generado sería %{example} y %{serial_number}."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/program/add_autogenerated_name_metadata_dialog.mas:172
msgctxt "program.autoname.guide.description"
